# A Battle with no protector asks its controller to choose an opponent as
# soon as any state-based-action check runs -- CR 704.5w, assignBattleProtector
# -- and StartTurn's own Untap-step beginPhase is the first one, so no
# advance is needed to reach it. Defense is set directly in setup.state:
# Move grants a Battle's printed starting defense on a real zone change
# (cast-a-battle-spell-resolves-to-battlefield is that case), but placing a
# card directly via setup.state (Game.NewCard) is exactly what the fixture
# says and nothing more, so without an explicit Counters:DEFENSE= here the
# Battle would die to zero defense before this scenario ever got to observe
# its protector.
queue battleprotector ai
startturn human
